      "text": "We are not going to pretend Fieldwire is bad. It is a capable construction field-management tool: plan viewing and mark-up, task assignment, punch lists, and coordination across a site team. If you run construction projects and need to manage plans and tasks against a drawing, Fieldwire is built for exactly that and does it well. Quickler is a different category. It does not manage drawings or punch lists and it is not trying to. It is the lightweight, no-app layer that captures inspections and compliance records on site, in WhatsApp. If you need construction task and plan management, Fieldwire is the right tool. If you just need inspections captured without an app, that is us."
